Cell["\<\
It is clear that tp0 is not equal to -d0/c. Here\[CloseCurlyQuote]s a \
numerical check.\
\>", "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.968230215985426*^9, 3.9682302328161697`*^9}, 
